Capacity development sessions conducted  for 33 County Area Advisory Council Members  &  50 Sub-county  AAC members for Matayos and  Teso North  sub-counties on Child Protection Standards of Operation Procedures and related Child Safeguarding Guidelines. In addition, County AACs members quarterly meeting supported with 30 members attending 
