description.narrative:
After the explosion on August 4th, 2020 in Beirut, Tdh, funded by Giro 555/SHO, has started its response immediately after the explosions in support of children in the blast area.&nbsp;
Phase 1 of the response (emergency): PSS, case management and caregiver support, guidance and counselling, provision of hygiene items and cash assistance.
Phase 2 (recovery): continue providing PSS services, caregiver program, case management, as well as&nbsp;support the education sector in the assessment of the education needs in the areas affected by the blast.&nbsp;

